  m_Name: Question9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MCQQuestionData
  questionText: 9. During flight through the transition layer the vertical position
    of the aircraft should be reported as
  referenceImage: {fileID: 0}
  explanationText: During descent through the transition layer, aircraft transition
    from flight levels to altitude. Therefore, vertical position is reported as altitude
    above mean sea level using QNH.
  options:
  - altitude above mean sea level during the climb
  - flight level during descent
  - either altitude above mean sea level or flight level during the climb
  - altitude above mean sea level during descent
  correctOptionIndex: 3
